#4471 merged **412 unique reports** about bookings landing on the wrong day. The reports contain
two distinct problems, so each needs its own ticket and count.

## Problems

### Parser reads day-first dates as month-first

**Covers 379 reports.** The shared parser reads every date month first, even for tenants whose
locale writes the day before the month. That flips the day and month in the booking.

Tracking ticket: [#1](https://github.com/codecleaner/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1).

### booking-v3 gives day-first tenants an `MM/DD/YYYY` hint

**Covers 33 reports.** `booking-v3` displays `MM/DD/YYYY` for day-first tenants, which directs
people to enter dates in an order their locale does not use.

Tracking ticket: [#2](https://github.com/codecleaner/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2).

